        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run, jump, and climb your way through deadly outposts in search of magical rubies!</strong><br><strong>Outpost Legends</strong> is a fast-paced platformer where precise movement and quick reflexes are key. Dodge <strong>spikes</strong>, leap over <strong>rotating saws</strong>, swing across <strong>ropes</strong>, and survive deep chasms — all while collecting shimmering rubies hidden throughout dangerous levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission is to collect every ruby, overcome every obstacle, and reclaim the stolen magic of a fallen kingdom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, powerful enchanted rubies brought prosperity to the land. But a ruthless mechanical tyrant seized them and locked them away inside his lethal strongholds. Now, only the most agile and determined hero can retrieve them and restore balance to the realm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Beautiful, hand-crafted pixel art levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Tight, responsive controls for skill-based platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 Collect hidden rubies while navigating trap-filled stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚙️ Avoid spikes, saws, collapsing platforms, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧗 Advanced movement: rope climbing, wall jumps, air control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Increasingly difficult levels that reward mastery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you overcome the fortress of steel and shadow?<br><strong>Your journey begins now — become the legend this kingdom needs.</strong></p>",
